    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feature:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Strategy and Flexible Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose 4 soldiers to send into battle, each with unique skills and roles. With simple controls, you can quickly move soldiers and use micro-tactics to adjust strategies, making each battle deep and challenging. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Support and Defense Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can deploy various support units, such as tank sentries, grenade sentries, and buff aura towers. These tower defense-style units can be upgraded during combat, allowing for flexible tactical adjustments to handle different enemies and situations. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 30 Types of Enemies and Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against over 30 types of monsters and take on epic, massive bosses, each with unique abilities and challenges. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly Generated Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game's map is randomly generated. Players can choose their own path, facing unknown enemies and challenges, ensuring that every adventure brings a new tactical experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through talent upgrades and relics, you can create unique combat styles, such as frost, fire, or HP reduction builds, adding even more variety to your tactical options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Iron Vulture</i>, you will take on the role of a commander responsible for making critical decisions. Send your squad into the unknown, face powerful enemies, and navigate dangerous situations. Every choice and strategy will determine the fate of your squad! Are you ready to lead your soldiers on an expedition to an unknown continent?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Feature:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/21be240ff254f7300d260d7c047a85e2.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tactical Strategy and Flexible Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose 4 soldiers to send into battle, each with unique skills and roles. With simple controls, you can quickly move soldiers and use micro-tactics to adjust strategies, making each battle deep and challenging. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/45789027d2bb7417f77aa37c7324043e.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Support and Defense Towers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can deploy various support units, such as tank sentries, grenade sentries, and buff aura towers. These tower defense-style units can be upgraded during combat, allowing for flexible tactical adjustments to handle different enemies and situations. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/a2e1ac742c65c196ca6ec445db331284.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Over 30 Types of Enemies and Epic Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against over 30 types of monsters and take on epic, massive bosses, each with unique abilities and challenges. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/f7f51016c518d0e59a3e470015efe156.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Randomly Generated Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game's map is randomly generated. Players can choose their own path, facing unknown enemies and challenges, ensuring that every adventure brings a new tactical experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/c3cf5719939e7f5cd46695c27ed01a78.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create Your Own Playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through talent upgrades and relics, you can create unique combat styles, such as frost, fire, or HP reduction builds, adding even more variety to your tactical options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/03b8624ac826be8ac18107f96544730a.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.poster.avif?t=1746937259\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.webm?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/968770/extras/8e841defb50450ce02de9252b1a9fefe.mp4?t=1746937259\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Iron Vulture</i>, you will take on the role of a commander responsible for making critical decisions. Send your squad into the unknown, face powerful enemies, and navigate dangerous situations. Every choice and strategy will determine the fate of your squad! Are you ready to lead your soldiers on an expedition to an unknown continent?</p>",
